sequenceDiagram
    actor utilisateur as Utilisateur
    participant panel as Home Panel
    participant api as Adaptateur HTTP Weather
    participant usecase as GetWeather Application
    participant provider as Port ForecastProvider
    participant openMeteo as Adaptateur Open Meteo
    participant geocoding as Open Meteo Geocoding
    participant forecast as Open Meteo Forecast

    utilisateur->>panel: Demande la meteo de La Ciotat
    panel->>api: GET /v1/weather/la-ciotat
    api->>usecase: Execute La Ciotat
    usecase->>provider: GetForecast La Ciotat
    provider->>openMeteo: Adapter request
    openMeteo->>geocoding: Search La Ciotat countryCode FR
    geocoding-->>openMeteo: Coordonnees et fuseau Europe Paris
    openMeteo->>forecast: Current daily et hourly forecast days 3
    forecast-->>openMeteo: Conditions et previsions brutes
    openMeteo->>openMeteo: Selectionner 09 15 et 21 heure locale
    openMeteo-->>provider: Rapport meteo normalise
    provider-->>usecase: Rapport meteo
    usecase-->>api: Conditions periodees et previsions
    api-->>panel: 200 JSON ou 502 weather unavailable
    panel-->>utilisateur: Meteo ou indisponibilite explicite
